{"title":"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems\">2019 AMC 10B #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 12B Problems\">2019 AMC 12B #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Comprehensive🧠)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Comprehensive🧠)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the statement, \"If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is not prime, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/9/ef9b02e32cfba0db0f9038a8d077596720f62e91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> is prime.\" Which of the following values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a counterexample to this statement?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca13699e50734f90862a4be804e3bd8cdc9ccc75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 11 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 15 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 19 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 21 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since a counterexample must be a value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> which is not prime, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be composite, so we eliminate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c43070a2acf8f4e25d98e48c404d9348a26d40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa04d7a9bcbf1fe3f2037cbc5e763c4b6d2661d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"13\" />. Now we subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from the remaining answer choices, and we see that the only time <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/9/ef9b02e32cfba0db0f9038a8d077596720f62e91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> is <b>not</b> prime is when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/61241a052dbdc7dd87c5b3c3e595d91fbcc7b749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"98\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~IronicNinja\n</p><p>minor edit (the inclusion of not) by AlcBoy1729\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CgZnUftXoig\">https://youtu.be/CgZnUftXoig</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Comprehensive.F0.9F.A7.A0.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Comprehensive🧠)\">Video Solution(Comprehensive🧠)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(Comprehensive🧠)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Gxq2rGTbhcQ\">https://youtu.be/Gxq2rGTbhcQ</a>\n</p><p>~Ani_lytical\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B\">2019 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w